admin-security-tab-overview = Overview
admin-security-tab-deployment = Deployment checks
admin-security-tab-denied = This security page is not available with your current permissions.
admin-security-tab-console = Console address
admin-console-path-title = Console address
admin-console-path-help = The admin console answers only at this address. Every other address, /admin included, gets the same "not found" page as any unknown address.
admin-console-path-limits = A hard-to-guess address keeps scanners and drive-by sign-in attempts away from the console. It does not separate the console from the mail app: both run on the same site, so the admin password, two-factor sign-in and network restrictions still matter.
admin-console-path-current = Current address:
admin-console-path-source-env = Set by MW_ADMIN_PATH on the server. To move the console, change or remove that variable and restart the server.
admin-console-path-source-stored = Chosen for this server.
admin-console-path-source-generated = Generated when this server was installed.
admin-console-path-source-upgrade = Kept from before the address could be configured.
admin-console-path-source-default = The built-in address.
admin-console-path-legacy = The console is at /admin, the first address scanners try. Choose an address of your own.
admin-console-path-pending = Moves to { $address } when the server restarts. All admin sessions end then; sign in again at the new address.
admin-console-path-new = New path
admin-console-path-new-help = Starts with /, followed by at least { $min } characters: letters, digits and . _ ~ - (use / to separate up to four parts).
admin-console-path-invalid = Use / followed by at least { $min } characters: letters, digits and . _ ~ -
admin-console-path-generate = Generate a random path
admin-console-path-save = Save new address
admin-console-path-confirm = Move the admin console?
admin-console-path-impact = The new address takes effect when the server restarts; until then the console stays where it is. After the restart all admin sessions end and the old address shows "not found". Write the new address down first.
admin-console-path-saved = Saved. The console moves when the server restarts.
